ount":12093341,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Natalie was once the Parson family's cherished daughter, but her world was shattered when Monica was unmasked as the true heiress. Manipulated by Monica, she was framed for their grandmother's murder and cast out by her family to a hellish reform school. Two years later, she was released, only to be forced into a marriage with a notorious alcoholic playboy. As the truth about her past and the horrors of that \"school\" come to light, Natalie watches everyone with a cold stare. Her storm of revenge has just begun.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":64,"totalWords":5616,"lastChapterId":14268871,"lastChapterTime":"2025-09-05 20:30:50","lastChapterName":"064","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Blood and Bones of the Disowned Daughter","tagsList":[{"id":521,"name":"Family","resourceUrl":"family-playlets-videos"},{"id":570,"name":"Heiress","resourceUrl":"heiress-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202509\u002Fcover-UzKxUJpfVo.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"blood-and-bones-of-the-disowned-daughter-31001113972","viewCountDisplay":"37.9M","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000881454","bookName":"A Mistaken Surrogate for the Ruthless Billionaire","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202412\u002Fcover-NZaBxU4d5Q.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":10427426,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Luciana Bridge caught her husband Alex cheating on her just as she was about to tell him the good news that she was pregnant with his baby after artificial insemination. Then she learnt of the sperm mix-up that has left her carrying the child of powerful billionaire David Carlson.\nLulu moves into David's mansion to become his secret surrogate and openly fiancée, only to discover that he wants more than just her surrogacy services.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":75,"totalWords":5644,"lastChapterId":10552303,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-07 01:08:14","lastChapterName":"075","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"A Mistaken Surrogate for the Ruthless Billionaire","tagsList":[{"id":614,"name":"Pregnancy","resourceUrl":"pregnancy-playlets-videos"},{"id":516,"name":"Sweet","resourceUrl":"sweet-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202412\u002Fcover-Us1XAllOu3.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"a-mistaken-surrogate-for-the-ruthless-billionaire-31000881454","viewCountDisplay":"32.7M","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000835181","bookName":"Don't Challenge the Lady Billionaire","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202409\u002Fcover-3XQNanuSkh.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":8216643,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Juliet, the president of a top financial conglomerate, hides her identity for love. She silently gives her all for seven years, only to be abandoned by her profit-driven boyfriend, Charles. To get revenge on Charles, she has a flash marriage with Charles' boss, Tristian. At an u