videos"},{"id":563,"name":"Female CEO","resourceUrl":"female-ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":597,"name":"Dynamic Duo","resourceUrl":"dynamic-duo-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202411\u002Fcover-MRrZoqD9wj.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"the-lady-boss-is-done-pretending-31000865838","viewCountDisplay":"12.7M","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001190038","bookName":"Baby Daddy That's Not Your Kid!","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202511\u002Fcover-tn77cee8mC.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":3994650,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Cleaner Betty’s night shift takes a fateful turn: she rescues a drugged stranger—unaware he’s elite tycoon Eli—and they share an impulsive night. The next morning, she slips away to help her best friend Ivy out of a crisis, , leaving Eli desperate to find her. Seizing the chance, Ivy poses as Eli’s mystery woman, lying outright that her ex-husband’s child is his—and steals Betty’s place entirely.\nBetty discovers she’s pregnant soon after starting medical school, raising the baby alone. Six years later, she becomes Eli’s household private physician. From their first meeting, Eli can’t shake the mother-daughter pair’s uncanny familiarity—a connection that makes him question everything…","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":73,"totalWords":6325,"lastChapterId":15613897,"lastChapterTime":"2025-11-26 19:38:09","lastChapterName":"073","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Baby Daddy That's Not Your Kid!","tagsList":[{"id":541,"name":"Cute Kids","resourceUrl":"cute-kids-playlets-videos"},{"id":537,"name":"Office Romance","resourceUrl":"office-romance-playlets-videos"},{"id":572,"name":"Attorney","resourceUrl":"attorney-playlets-videos"},{"id":586,"name":"One-Night Stand","resourceUrl":"one-night-stand-playlets-videos"},{"id":618,"name":"Misidentification","resourceUrl":"misidentification-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202511\u002Fcover-2idEMwfgk9.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"baby-daddy-that-s-not-your-kid-31001190038","viewCountDisplay":"12.5M","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001099700","bookName":"Trapped and Redeemed By His Love","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202508\u002Fcover-3ODbMBGUTR.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":3909310,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Saddled with her father’s crippling debt, Yvette breaks up with her boyfriend Archer by pretending to sleep with another man. But while chasing her, Archer gets run over by a car and nearly dies. Years later, Yvette is secretly raising Archer’s son, while Archer’s conquered the business world. When their paths cross again, their mutual hatred and repressed love engulf them both like flames…","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":73,"totalWords":5802,"lastChapterId":14114651,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-26 21:00:43","lastChapterName":"073","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Trapped and Redeemed By His Love","tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":526,"name":"Second Chance","resourceUrl":"second-chance-playlets-videos"},{"id":541,"name":"Cute Kids","resourceUrl":"cute-kids-playlets-videos"},{"id":612,"name":"Misunderstanding","resourceUrl":"misunderstanding-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202508\u002Fcover-lEAdF1ZD5H.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"trapped-and-redeemed-by-his-love-31001099700","viewCountDisplay":"12.2M","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000810138","bookName":"Will You Be My Love Again?","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202408\u002Fcover-QpojSQmqTu.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":3394603,"ratings":0,"introduction":"George, the heir to a wealthy family, was saved by Melody when they were children. He gave her a lucky necklace and promised to find her when they grew up and repay the favor. After years of searching in vain, George marries a woman with a crippled leg. He lets others bully her, even causing her to miss her mother's last moments. She asks for a divorce, and George discovers too late that she was Melody all along. Realizing how badly he treated her, George decides to get her back. But Melody also runs into trouble when she goes back to her father who always disliked her, and her tormenting stepmother and stepsister. Will Melody be able to get back what she deserves?","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":72,"totalWords":5105,"lastChapterId":9294981,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-08 08:20:09","lastChapterName":"072","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Will You Be My Love Again?","tagsList":[{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":538,"name":"Redemption","resourceUrl":"redemption-playlets-videos"},{"id":581,"name":"Cinderella","resourceUrl":"cinderella-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":618,"name":"Misidentification","resourceUrl":"misidentification-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"bookCover":"videobook\u002F202408\u002Fcover-nziKWxO4Pi.jpg","read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"will-you-be-my-love-again-31000810138","viewCountDisplay":"10.6M","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"}],"totalPage":218,"total":2612,"popular":"POPULAR","browsePath":"\u002Fdramas\u002Fplaylets","browsePathLang":"en","typeTwoResourceUrl":"playlets","bookTypeParam":{"bookTypeOne":{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","typeTwoResourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"},"bookTypeTwo":{"id":149,"name":"Suspense","typeTwoResourceUrl":"suspense-149-playlets"}},"nullPage":false,"typeNewBookList":[{"bookId":"31001426035","bookName":"I Was Murdered by Dad’s Criminal and Autopsied by Mom 2","pseudonym":"YY","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202606\u002Fcover-hOaBpuGZx7.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202606\u002F4b5f0a5aa6d63a594c5cb926ece9107159aa1aa35993ebf9a5aa22afff9f0e1ef641f9e71bfe42ad7da24774d7e75cf4.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":5733,"ratings":0,"introduction":"While the criminal was brutally killing me, my dad, the head of the criminal investigation division, and my mom, the chief forensic pathologist, were attending my sister Lily Lambert’s match. In a bid for revenge, the criminal, who had once been captured by my dad, cut out my tongue and used my phone to call him. My dad only said one thing before hanging up. \"No matter what’s going on, Lily’s match is the top priority today!\" The criminal sneered, \"Seems I’ve kidnapped the wrong person. I thought they would love their biological daughter more!\" At the crime scene, my parents were shocked by the brutal state of the body and condemned the cruelty of the killer. However, they did not realize that the horrifically mutilated corpse was their own daughter.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":35,"totalWords":2493,"lastChapterId":19347189,"lastChapterTime":"2026-06-04 11:42:16","lastChapterName":"035","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Urban"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"I Was Murdered by Dad’s Criminal and Autopsied by Mom 2","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":521,"name":"Family","resourceUrl":"family-playlets-videos"},{"id":528,"name":"Twisted","resourceUrl":"twisted-playlets-videos"},{"id":570,"name":"Heiress","resourceUrl":"heiress-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":136,"name":"Urban","resourceUrl":"urban-136-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"i-was-murdered-by-dad-s-criminal-and-autopsied-by-mom-2-31001426035","viewCountDisplay":"18.0K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001005199","bookName":"While She Starved","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202504\u002Fcover-1tNIQQDW5k.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202504\u002F9576349dac4b1b77ce7ae032782ffd7c6bf97e6966e6857c04d8ebf51dc6c40f20b05a1a722035bfd69098214ea0afda.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":135911,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Fern Burke's husband, Edwin Smith is supporting both households, his own and that of his sister-in-law. He argues that Vera Green, his sister-in-law, would become the subject of gossip since her husband has died, so he brings her along to the military, leaving Fern behind in the countryside. Every month, he sends Fern three love letters, yet gives all his military allowance to Vera. During the famine, Vera and her two children stay comfortably in Edwin's city home, eating meat buns, while Fern and her children starve to death in silence. Fortunately, Fern has been given a second chance at life. This time, she won't suffer quietly…","labels":["Rebirth","Revenge","Marriage","Love-Triangle"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":69,"totalWords":7460,"lastChapterId":12410896,"lastChapterTime":"2025-05-12 16:10:01","lastChapterName":"069","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"While She Starved","tagsList":[{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":525,"name":"Revenge","resourceUrl":"revenge-playlets-videos"},{"id":523,"name":"Reborn","resourceUrl":"reborn-playlets-videos"},{"id":554,"name":"Strong Female Lead","resourceUrl":"strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"},{"id":619,"name":"Getting Back at Ex","resourceUrl":"getting-back-at-ex-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"while-she-starved-31001005199","labelsResourceUrl":["rebirth-playlets-videos","revenge-playlets-videos","marriage-playlets-videos","love-triangle-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"426.7K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001427365","bookName":"They Banished Me from the Pack—Now They're Howling for Me Back","pseudonym":"YY","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202606\u002Fcover-JOfZuCYEI2.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202606\u002F1cbebde7a97c5a885e2a90699f3b9a0f387f134a558bb8cef38ef32786a3bf08c01ff466bbaa918de4cf3554ccb61e8a.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":6360,"ratings":0,"introduction":"When my mind-link request had been ignored by my parents for the twentieth time, I went to the Werewolf Council, clutching the report on silver dust corrosion in my hand. “Hello. I’d like to renounce my pack identity—effective immediately.” Ten minutes later, my parents burst in, dragging my adoptive younger sister, Elsa, with them, panic written all over their faces. The door burst open with a bang, and my Beta father charged in like a storm. His fangs bared, claws twitching. “You’re nothing but a spoiled brat craving attention! Stop this pathetic act. You’re an embarrassment to a Beta’s name!” My mother, a forensic specialist for the pack, immediately snatched the report from my hand. After a brief glance, she let out a cold sneer. “You faked this report just to get our attention? You’ve been a liar since you were a pup.” Elsa clung to both of them, tears in her eyes as she sobbed, “I’m sorry, Jenifer. It’s my fault for holding the shifting ritual. But please... don’t lie to our parents just to make them feel guilty!” Blood was still pouring from my nose, but I wiped it away calmly and stood tall before the werewolf councilors once more. “I haven’t had a real family for a long time. Please—remove all my personal records from the pack. I just don’t want my funeral—scheduled for three days from now—to be delayed.”","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":32,"totalWords":2301,"lastChapterId":19900570,"lastChapterTime":"2026-06-05 10:22:24","lastChapterName":"032","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Fantasy"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"They Banished Me from the Pack—Now They're Howling for Me Back","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":521,"name":"Family","resourceUrl":"family-playlets-videos"},{"id":528,"name":"Twisted","resourceUrl":"twisted-playlets-videos"},{"id":548,"name":"Werewolf","resourceUrl":"werewolf-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"they-banished-me-from-the-pack-now-they-re-howling-for-me-back-31001427365","viewCountDisplay":"19.9K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001233512","bookName":"SSS-Rank with No Way to Die","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202512\u002Fcover-A1A0O6EMCW.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202512\u002F4f287a2d0c75dc52f93c249e3f8da07348477a96bf8e0b6821f5c6af192070504b6141dadebe44ef4b7d241ef190553f.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":30689,"ratings":0,"introduction":"This is an era where games invade reality and talents awaken.Impoverished high school student Xavier Knight harbors a secret—he can regenerate infinitely. To successfully class-change, Xavier trades his lifespan for money and awakens as an SSS-rank sorcerer. His exceptional talent makes him a target for assassination, but with his infinite regeneration cheat ability, he relentlessly levels up and crushes his opponents.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":40,"totalWords":5713,"lastChapterId":16077211,"lastChapterTime":"2025-12-25 10:12:54","lastChapterName":"040","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Fantasy"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":1,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"SSS-Rank with No Way to Die","supportHorizontal":1,"tagsList":[{"id":520,"name":"Time Travel","resourceUrl":"time-travel-playlets-videos"},{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"},{"id":558,"name":"Small Potato","resourceUrl":"small-potato-playlets-videos"},{"id":733,"name":"Anime","resourceUrl":"anime-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"sss-rank-with-no-way-to-die-31001233512","viewCountDisplay":"96.3K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001429615","bookName":"New Life, New Mate 2","pseudonym":"YY","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202606\u002Fcover-66xVfBb78t.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202606\u002F1cef08d14b45c0101645117927543b75bde5ea462ac90a3d2615954bae7ce1dc9620a9501105563b06b99be64471acd1.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":7663,"ratings":0,"introduction":"On my eighteenth birthday, Alpha called me up in front of the whole pack and told me to choose—one of his sons as my mate. Whichever I chose? He'd be the next Alpha. I didn't flinch. I picked Cayce, his eldest. The room went dead silent. Everyone knew I used to be stupidly in love with Kain, the younger one. I'd confessed at every pack dance. Took a silver dagger for him once. Cayce? Coldest, meanest wolf we had. Total menace. No one got close. But they didn't know the truth. In my last life, I was bonded to Kain. On the day of our Bonding Ceremony, he slept with Lena, my cousin. My mom lost it. Shipped Lena off to Duskwolf Pack to get bonded to their Beta. Kain? He blamed me. Paraded in she-wolves with Lena's same ice-blue eyes. When he found out I was carrying his pup, he made sure I saw him with every one of them. It was torture. When labor hit, he locked me in the dungeon. Blocked everyone out. My pup got crushed. I died hating him. Maybe the Moon Goddess felt sorry for me—she gave me a second shot. I came back. This time? I let Kain keep Lena. Didn't think he would ever regret it.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":32,"totalWords":2354,"lastChapterId":25265898,"lastChapterTime":"2026-06-08 10:05:33","lastChapterName":"032","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Fantasy"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"New Life, New Mate 2","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":523,"name":"Reborn","resourceUrl":"reborn-playlets-videos"},{"id":524,"name":"Dark Romance","resourceUrl":"dark-romance-playlets-videos"},{"id":543,"name":"Alpha","resourceUrl":"alpha-playlets-videos"},{"id":590,"name":"Love Triangle","resourceUrl":"love-triangle-playlets-videos"},{"id":592,"name":"Contract Marriage","resourceUrl":"contract-marriage-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"new-life-new-mate-2-31001429615","viewCountDisplay":"24.0K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001061945","bookName":"Best Friend or Deadly Lie?","pseudonym":"nana","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202507\u002Fcover-VMCrzju573.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202507\u002F8014ccedca43d95dbd75e95d0b124d9b5265f2dede382f49a7871a2edcfb368f067ac763434648ce0c2b428dfd11dd4f.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":218132,"ratings":0,"introduction":"In her previous life, Laura Hampton mistook a cunning woman for her closest friend and gradually fell into the web of lies spun by Angela Harrison. Cast aside by her family, she met a tragic end beneath Angela's car.This time around, Laura knows the truth: her childhood savior was never Angela. Seeing through Angela’s façade, she decisively steers clear of her traps—and discovers that Eric Pearson has been quietly watching over her all along, in both lifetimes.Slowly, Laura exposes Angela's true face to her parents, ultimately driving her out of the Hampton family and ensuring she faces the consequences she deserves.","labels":["Rebirth","Counterattack","strong female lead"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":80,"totalWords":7263,"lastChapterId":13273141,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-14 15:47:08","lastChapterName":"080","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Best Friend or Deadly Lie?","tagsList":[{"id":523,"name":"Reborn","resourceUrl":"reborn-playlets-videos"},{"id":619,"name":"Getting Back at Ex","resourceUrl":"getting-back-at-ex-playlets-videos"},{"id":570,"name":"Heiress","resourceUrl":"heiress-playlets-videos"},{"id":618,"name":"Misidentification","resourceUrl":"misidentification-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"best-friend-or-deadly-lie-31001061945","labelsResourceUrl":["rebirth-playlets-videos","counterattack-playlets-videos","strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"684.9K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"}],"typeRecommendBookList":[{"bookId":"31000671772","bookName":"In the Name of Love","pseudonym":"Sue","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202312\u002Fcover-EGm6VvnWUS.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202312\u002F8e017990fc40343479f27ecc9d7c2c001e0de45353cb4ce904654ae3d0eaa26da3e6cf881cb2289820261a908461d57e.jpg","viewCount":90413,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Anna Poole had faced hardships since childhood. While trying to resolve a company crisis with her good friend, Serene Cox, Anna was drugged and sold to Mr. King. After Anna injured Mr. King and escaped, she ended up in the room of another man, Zach Howl, who was also under the influence of an aphrodisiac. As a result, they unexpectedly became intimate. As soon as Anna regained consciousness, she decided to confront Serene and accidentally overheard a conspiracy between Serene and the supposedly deceased Bryan Lane. Outraged, Anna confronted Serene, who injured her and caused a fire to start. In a life-threatening situation, Anna was saved by Waver Taylor, who had just returned to the country. Ten months later, she gave birth to twins, and one of them was taken away by the Browns. Along with a doctor, the Brown mother and daughter falsely claimed that the child died to suffocation.","labels":["Destiny","Baby","Soulmate"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":92,"totalWords":8456,"lastChapterId":6678294,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-15 01:25:25","lastChapterName":"92","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"In the Name of Love","tagsList":[{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":527,"name":"Destiny","resourceUrl":"destiny-playlets-videos"},{"id":541,"name":"Cute Kids","resourceUrl":"cute-kids-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":586,"name":"One-Night Stand","resourceUrl":"one-night-stand-playlets-videos"},{"id":615,"name":"Little Cupids","resourceUrl":"little-cupids-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"in-the-name-of-love-31000671772","labelsResourceUrl":["destiny-playlets-videos","baby-playlets-videos","soulmate-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"283.8K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000939687","bookName":"The One Who Loves Me Above All","pseudonym":"cyan","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202502\u002Fcover-AMX9dK05zd.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202502\u002Fb814e7bed68ab3fc8f7ba08194bf8c8b76f2a0376fdb4edfca385e6e1cee688e998a0d17e2abd3c9e8b50bdfaf0a2967.jpg","viewCount":90160,"ratings":0,"introduction":"At the five-year wedding anniversary celebration of Scott and Joyce, Joyce's half-sister, Tina, suddenly appeared, demanding Joyce return Scott to her. Tina deliberately pushed Joyce, causing her to miscarry. Instead of helping Joyce, Scott chose to leave with Tina, plunging Joyce into despair. She decided to divorce Scott and attempted to take her own life by jumping into the sea. After Joyce vanished, Scott initially believed it was all an act, but he gradually discovered the misunderstandings and Tina's schemes, realizing that the woman who loved him the most was gone forever.","labels":["Marriage","Love-Triangle","Comeback"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":70,"totalWords":7200,"lastChapterId":11430199,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-12 22:08:16","lastChapterName":"070","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"The One Who Loves Me Above All","tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":561,"name":"Housewife","resourceUrl":"housewife-playlets-videos"},{"id":590,"name":"Love Triangle","resourceUrl":"love-triangle-playlets-videos"},{"id":612,"name":"Misunderstanding","resourceUrl":"misunderstanding-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"the-one-who-loves-me-above-all-31000939687","labelsResourceUrl":["marriage-playlets-videos","love-triangle-playlets-videos","comeback-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"283.1K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000880913","bookName":"Once Familiar, Now a Stranger","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202412\u002Fcover-vCeYRhErpb.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202412\u002Fcea182ec577a9d459b705650cb6afe82a3ff9fa4b98fd11755aa88e3380871d163704d637ef2bdb1b303ccc5aea51844.jpg","viewCount":89962,"ratings":0,"introduction":"At a concert seven years ago, the iconic singer, Carmen Rowe, announced her sudden retirement from the music industry. She had found the boy she'd been searching for. The boy, now known as Ben Lewis, was the CEO of Lewis Group and had lost his eyesight in a car accident. Carmen pretended to be a mute and stayed by his side. Under her meticulous care, Ben eventually regained his vision after removing his bandages. However, the moment he could see again, he ran straight to his first love, Carmela Taylor. Heartbroken by the rejection despite all she had done, Carmen decided to divorce Ben and return to the music industry with her daughter. Later, Ben organized a grand comeback concert for Carmela. But during the performance, he recognized that Carmela's voice wasn't the legendary one he remembered. It was only then that he realized the truth. By that time, Carmen Rowe had fully reclaimed her status as the top music diva and had no intention of giving Ben another chance.","labels":["Second Chance","Bitter Love","Hidden Identity","Star","entertainment circle"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":64,"totalWords":6938,"lastChapterId":10535505,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-14 06:30:32","lastChapterName":"064","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Once Familiar, Now a Stranger","tagsList":[{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"},{"id":554,"name":"Strong Female Lead","resourceUrl":"strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"},{"id":609,"name":"Hate-love","resourceUrl":"hate-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"once-familiar-now-a-stranger-31000880913","labelsResourceUrl":["second-chance-playlets-videos","bitter-love-playlets-videos","hidden-identity-playlets-videos","star-playlets-videos","entertainment-circle-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"282.4K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000913315","bookName":"Hippocratic Romance","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202501\u002Fcover-zSGfPNVUF4.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202501\u002F93ec619682728f25ae2c443b893557742afe20f356fa1751c02e2db90fdfcefebc8b031872ee02e8023a76bdaab72f3a.jpg","viewCount":89810,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Yasin Craig, the heir to the prestigious Craig family and a special forces soldier, survives a plane crash during his final mission, only to be saved by battlefield doctor Xenia Jones. When Yasin regains consciousness, he has no memory of who he is. Meanwhile, Yuna, who stumbles upon the ring symbolizing Yasin's identity, is determined to secure wealth and status. She deceives Yasin's mother and becomes the adopted daughter of the Craig family. Fearing that Xenia might uncover the truth, Yuna starts to aggressively undermine her. Unable to remember his past, Yasin finds himself protecting Xenia—and in the process, unexpectedly regains his memory.","labels":["Hidden Identity","Billionaire","Destiny"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":82,"totalWords":7631,"lastChapterId":11065089,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-13 21:56:16","lastChapterName":"082","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Hippocratic Romance","tagsList":[{"id":516,"name":"Sweet","resourceUrl":"sweet-playlets-videos"},{"id":569,"name":"Heir","resourceUrl":"heir-playlets-videos"},{"id":621,"name":"Memory Loss","resourceUrl":"memory-loss-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"hippocratic-romance-31000913315","labelsResourceUrl":["hidden-identity-playlets-videos","billionaire-playlets-videos","destiny-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"282.0K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000775547","bookName":"Wrong Groom, Right Husband","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202406\u002Fcover-1aovBSmuVH.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202406\u002F6620ee604c1843b7ab9985b8aefbc5fce127dc49923929e63b9da9033d5cc9bf077882febd32de833e59f5d033b4e35c.jpg","viewCount":89745,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Bryanna's poor boyfriend cheated on her with her best friend and plotted to sell her to human traffickers. However, fate intervenes when Bryanna mistakenly marries the company's CEO instead of the old man... With a marriage at hand and a grandmother pushing for blind dates, the CEO decides to make the best of it by marrying Bryanna. Initially a transaction of convenience, however, later both of them unexpectedly invest their true feelings...","labels":["Marriage","CEO"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":82,"totalWords":6115,"lastChapterId":8666158,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-14 10:48:09","lastChapterName":"082","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Wrong Groom, Right Husband","tagsList":[{"id":516,"name":"Sweet","resourceUrl":"sweet-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":586,"name":"One-Night Stand","resourceUrl":"one-night-stand-playlets-videos"},{"id":588,"name":"Flash-Marriage","resourceUrl":"flash-marriage-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"wrong-groom-right-husband-31000775547","labelsResourceUrl":["marriage-playlets-videos","ceo-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"281.7K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31000758198","bookName":"Vengeance's Triumph","pseudonym":"GINA","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202405\u002Fcover-CJvWQOSv76.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202405\u002F6b0423b07c6b784e4d4ec5733bc1de126899544784cadbe099c5c727d863aed3fdc6da2a585bf244097c40552934f0ba.jpg","viewCount":89742,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Jessica Jensen, originally a carefree rich girl, enjoyed the love and protection of her family. However, for the sake of love, she gave up wealth and chose to marry the poor Albert. Ignoring her family's objections, she cut off all contact with them and strived to be a good wife. Unfortunately, Albert cheated on her with her sister, Nana Jensen. This betrayal plunged Jessica into deep pain and despair. Reconnecting with her family, Jessica poured out her grievances and pain. Her father then decided to host a grand feast to welcome her back to the family and seek revenge for her. At the feast, Nana, dressed to impress, believed she was the star of the event, expecting the family to recognize her as a distant relative. Nana used the occasion to show off, but Jessica's three childhood friends appeared one by one, confirming Jessica's identity and shattering Nana's dreams. However, Nana spread rumors that Jessica had inappropriate relationships with the three friends. Jessica's father stepped in, ready to expose everything. Yet Jessica stopped him, choosing to take revenge herself. In the storm of her life, Jessica bravely faced the challenges. Rather than depending on her family, she decided to take up arms and fight back against the betrayers and rumor-mongers. In this battle of revenge, she would emerge victorious with her own strength.","labels":["strong female lead","Divorce"],"commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":92,"totalWords":7870,"lastChapterId":8441308,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-16 16:45:12","lastChapterName":"092","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Urban"],"typeTwoResourceUrls":["romance-playlets-286"],"grade":"PLUS4","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"TRANSLATION","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Vengeance's Triumph","tagsList":[{"id":518,"name":"Underdog Rise","resourceUrl":"underdog-rise-playlets-videos"},{"id":570,"name":"Heiress","resourceUrl":"heiress-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"},{"id":525,"name":"Revenge","resourceUrl":"revenge-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":136,"name":"Urban","resourceUrl":"urban-136-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"vengeance-s-triumph-31000758198","labelsResourceUrl":["strong-female-lead-playlets-videos","divorce-playlets-videos"],"viewCountDisplay":"281.7K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"}],"hotSearchesList":[{"id":25867716,"keyword":"tycoon","keywordPrefix":"T","keywordFormat":"tycoon","status":0},{"id":25868251,"keyword":"rekindled heartache","keywordPrefix":"R","keywordFormat":"rekindled-heartache","status":0},{"id":25869504,"keyword":"eng dub","keywordPrefix":"E